Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.66,0:02:28.26,Note,0,0,0,0,,（阿冈戈化学武器工厂 苏联）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.00,0:03:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 忘了敲门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg your pardon. I forgot to knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.34,0:03:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱动
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.85,0:03:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.15,0:03:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.52,0:04:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谁不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't we all?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.82,0:04:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你迟到了 007 - 我得去上厕所\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're late, 007. - I had to stop in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.36,0:04:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,又准备拯救世界吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to save the world again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.10,0:04:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先请 006\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you, 006.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.77,0:04:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 为英国\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, for England.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.27,0:04:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,为英国 艾力克\N{\fnArial\fs30}For England, Alec.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.22,0:05:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,太容易了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.02,0:05:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有事情一半都是靠运气 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half of everything is luck, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.72,0:05:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一半呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the other half?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.86,0:05:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.93,0:05:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 计时六分钟 - 六分钟 无误\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Set timers: six minutes. - Six minutes, check.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.53,0:05:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.36,0:05:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,打烊了 詹姆斯！最后一次！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Closing time, James! Last call!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.97,0:05:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我买一品脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buy me a pint.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.72,0:06:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是巫上校 举起双手出来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Colonel Ourumov! Come out with your hands above your heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.72,0:06:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How original.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.80,0:06:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alec?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.48,0:06:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来 放下武器慢慢走过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move out Throw down your weapon and walk towards me, slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.35,0:06:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快完成任务 轰掉他们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finish the job, James! Blow them all to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.59,0:06:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你十秒钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.49,0:06:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,十…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.79,0:06:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,…九…八…\N{\fnArial\fs30}nine… eight…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.10,0:06:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,七…六…\N{\fnArial\fs30}seven… six…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.73,0:07:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,…五…\N{\fnArial\fs30}five…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.50,0:07:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,…四 三 二…\N{\fnArial\fs30}four… three… two…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.10,0:07:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,为英国 詹姆斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}For England, James!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.81,0:07:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,停火！会打到瓦斯桶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire! You'll blow the gas tanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.35,0:07:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你最后机会 举起手出来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your last chance. Come out with your hands above your…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.89,0:07:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.85,0:08:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来！快！快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out there! Move! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.37,0:08:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要开火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.81,0:09:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.50,0:10:56.83,Title,0,0,0,0,,《007系列之黄金眼》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.09,0:13:32.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（九年后）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.76,0:13:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 你真的有必要开得这么快吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, is it really necessary to drive quite so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.63,0:13:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你预想的要经常多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}More often than you'd think.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.31,0:13:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也像别的女孩一样爱坐飞车 不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I enjoy a spirited ride as much as the next girl, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.69,0:14:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是谁？- 别的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's that? - The next girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.02,0:15:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 别这样！打住！我知道你想干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, stop this! Stop it! I know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.29,0:15:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？我在干嘛 亲爱的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? What's that, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.43,0:15:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是现你的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are just trying to show off the size of your, your…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.50,0:15:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 引擎？- 自大狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Engine? - Ego.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.37,0:15:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开车寻开心你却来这套心理分析\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're having a pleasant drive and you've got to bring psychology into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.70,0:15:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我奉命来评估你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just sent here to evaluate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.01,0:15:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是别想公事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's try and put that behind us, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.64,0:16:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士优先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.69,0:16:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 詹姆斯 我让你停车 - 真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- James, I want you to stop this car. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.30,0:16:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上停车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop this car at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.97,0:16:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看…我完全能遵守女上司的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see, I have no problem with female authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.98,0:16:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 你真是无药可救\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, you're incorrigible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.39,0:16:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿你没辙\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I going to do with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.12,0:16:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 为你的评估干杯好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's toast your evaluation, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.77,0:17:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,彻底的评估\N{\fnArial\fs30}A very thorough evaluation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.90,0:17:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 邦德先生 欢迎再次光临
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.81,0:17:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 皮耶 你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.54,0:17:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 很好 你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.19,0:18:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madame wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.64,0:18:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人下注吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bets, ladies and gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.41,0:18:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人下注？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No players?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.55,0:18:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.29,0:18:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们兴趣相投 只不过三种\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears we share the same passions. Three, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.16,0:18:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为两种\N{\fnArial\fs30}I count two.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.16,0:18:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,开车和玩牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Motoring and baccarat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.37,0:18:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,七点 女士赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven. Madame wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.81,0:18:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望第三种是你真正的看家本颌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope the third is where your real talent lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.55,0:18:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决不退缩\N{\fnArial\fs30}One rises to meet a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.01,0:19:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,要牌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.42,0:19:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士手上有五点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madame stands with five.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.16,0:19:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,六点 女士输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six. Madame loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.86,0:19:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,及时行乐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy it while it lasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.87,0:19:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的座右铭\N{\fnArial\fs30}The very words I live by.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.11,0:19:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的座右铭是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what words do you live by?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.78,0:20:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,见机行事 见好就收\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trick is to quit while you're still ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.35,0:20:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这本事我可学不来 不如你教我别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one trick I've never learned. Perhaps you'll show me how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.12,0:20:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏特加马丁尼 用摇的 不要搅的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vodka martini. Shaken, not stirred.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.19,0:20:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.86,0:20:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.56,0:20:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么喝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.49,0:20:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不加冰…加柠檬皮…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight up, with a twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.80,0:20:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 先生您是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mr…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.64,0:20:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫邦德 詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name's Bond. James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.81,0:20:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎妮安娜拓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Xenia Zaragevna Onatopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.04,0:20:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安娜拓？- 安娜拓\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Onatopp? - Onatopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.01,0:20:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是乔治亚人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your accent, Georgian?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.02,0:20:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.18,0:20:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去过俄国？- 最近没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've been to Russia? - Not recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.25,0:20:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前偶尔去一去 快进快出\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to drop in occasionally. Shoot in and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.22,0:20:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在大不相同了 一个冒险家乐园\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very different now, a land of opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.86,0:20:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,家家车库停着新的法拉利？\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a new Ferrari in every garage?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.83,0:20:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那倒不是 这车是朋友的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not quite. That belongs to a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.03,0:20:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你朋友个建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tip for your friend:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.77,0:21:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,今年法国车牌是“L”宇开头\N{\fnArial\fs30}The French registration plates for this year's model start with the letter "L."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.67,0:21:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,仿造的也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the counterfeit ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.24,0:21:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在交通部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. And what rank do you hold…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.41,0:21:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,当什么差…邦德先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the Motor Vehicles Department, Mr. Bond?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.35,0:21:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,中校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.09,0:21:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 咱们走吧？- 这位是上将\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shall we go? - This one is an Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.39,0:21:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比官阶更喜欢女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like a woman who enjoys pulling rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.59,0:21:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to meet you, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.26,0:21:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,全是我的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pleasure, I'm sure, was all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.92,0:22:27.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（曼蒂哥号）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.72,0:22:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱班霓开始传送\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transmission begins from Moneypenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.09,0:23:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,确认身份 莎妮安娜拓 前苏联战斗机驾驶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Identification confirmed: Onatopp, Xenia. Ex-Soviet fighter pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.69,0:23:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,该嫌犯与圣彼得堡的亚努犯罪组织有联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Current suspected links to the Janus crime syndicate, St. petersburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.83,0:23:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼蒂哥号租给亚努的公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yacht Manticore is leased to a known Janus corporate front.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.20,0:23:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,M准许你观察安小姐…\N{\fnArial\fs30}M authorizes you to observe Miss Onatopp…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.27,0:23:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但未获准许不得与她接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}but stipulates no contact without prior approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.01,0:23:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱班霓 传送完毕 晚安 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}End transmission. Moneypenny. Good night, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.31,0:23:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你会“小心行事”\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you'll stay "on-a-topp" of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.69,0:24:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎妮 我不能呼吸了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Xenia, I can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.04,0:24:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯！嗯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.04,0:25:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,向您致敬 上将！\N{\fnArial\fs30}My respects, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.58,0:25:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎莅临\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delighted to have you aboard, Mademoiselle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.88,0:25:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位女士们先生们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.75,0:25:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,请上甲板观赏直升机演练\N{\fnArial\fs30}please take your seats on the upper deck for the demonstration of the aircraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.36,0:26:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看到的将是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you are about to see in operation…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.43,0:26:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧洲对电子战的答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}is Europe's answer to the electronic battlefield:
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.20,0:26:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个”猛虎”直升机原型\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first working prototype of the Tiger helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.83,0:26:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅使用特殊灵活的“隐形”科技…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uniquely maneuverable, the Tiger not only uses stealth technology…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.67,0:26:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,…更能防御任何…\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is the only helicopter to be hardened against…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.81,0:26:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,…电子干扰、无线电或…\N{\fnArial\fs30}all forms of electronic interference…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.94,0:26:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,…电磁辐射线的唯一的直升机机种\N{\fnArial\fs30}radio jamming and electromagnetic radiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.95,0:26:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从你们基地那里的朋友带给你们一个小小的惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a small surprise from your friends back at the barracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.72,0:26:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我走运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I've gone to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.13,0:26:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.40,0:27:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在请欢迎驾驶员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now please welcome the pilots.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.87,0:27:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾少校以及白上尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant Commander Bernard Jaubert…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.04,0:27:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空武器控制中心 俄国 塞维亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Lieutenant Francois Brouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.21,0:28:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,选项\N{\fnArial\fs30}Select Mir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.02,0:28:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,自动绘图投射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Autographic projection.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.39,0:28:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,计算拦截第二测地卫星距离 输入密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Compute possible intercept with second stage geo-sat two.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.43,0:28:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.80,0:28:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,既便是女人投怀送抱他都无法接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wouldn't know a woman if one came up and sat on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.94,0:28:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,波洛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boris.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.81,0:28:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 波洛！- 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Boris! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.55,0:29:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得我不是登在网路上了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I'd post it on the Internet, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.15,0:29:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 密码是什么？- 这次我写个简单的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the password? - I made it easy this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.82,0:29:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就连你都能破译 真是笨蛋一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even you should be able to break it, borscht for brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.56,0:29:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 给你个提示\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right, I'll give you a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.73,0:29:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在你眼前可以打开很大的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're right in front of you and can open very large doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.50,0:29:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,密码门环 你真讨厌！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're such a geek.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.07,0:29:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好棒！我进入了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm in!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.38,0:29:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经闯入了美国司法部\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've hacked into the U.S. Department of Justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.72,0:29:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道被追查到的后果吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what will happen if they trace it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.79,0:29:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑部主任会把我当天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Chief of Computers will call me a genius…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.49,0:29:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,…调找到莫斯科 给我一百万元\N{\fnArial\fs30}move me to Moscow and give me a million bucks hard currency.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.53,0:29:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,才怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think not.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.43,0:29:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 美国人很笨 绝对查不到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, the Americans are slug-heads. They'll never detect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.94,0:29:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说他们很笨？- 没人敢惹我葛波洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were saying, slug-head? - Nobody screws with Boris Grishenko!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.18,0:30:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏他们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spiked them!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.71,0:30:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快挂断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Boris, just hang up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.88,0:30:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不！我破坏他们了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way! I spiked them!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.75,0:30:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 密码是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, what's the password?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.42,0:30:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.56,0:30:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.49,0:30:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是在我前面吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not in front of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.20,0:30:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能坐在上面却不能带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sit on it, but you can't take it with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.54,0:30:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的程式能够拦截任何追踪我的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}My program seizes the phone line of whoever's tracing me…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.14,0:30:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,干扰数据机 他们无法挂断\N{\fnArial\fs30}and jams their modem so they can't hang up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.25,0:30:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在猎物变成猎人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the hunted becomes the hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.64,0:30:42.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（联邦调查局电脑诈欺部）
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.95,0:30:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你下次好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better luck next time…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.06,0:30:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}slug-heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.56,0:30:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bang! Gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.09,0:30:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所向无敌！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am invincible!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.20,0:31:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是也过瘾吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it good for you, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.50,0:31:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去喝咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting some coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.24,0:31:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去抽一支烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going for a cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.77,0:32:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿凯蒂巫洛莫将车\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Arkady Grigorovich Ourumov…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.71,0:32:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空部负责人\N{\fnArial\fs30}head of Space Division.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.32,0:32:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 将军 若我知道… - 你应该已经准备就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- General, if I'd known… - You'd have been ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.79,0:32:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是临时战争模拟试验\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an unscheduled test of the Severnaya facility. War simulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.26,0:32:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要试发黄金眼 请报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are going to test-fire GoldenEye. Report your status.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.57,0:32:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,两枚卫星 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two operational satellites, sir: Petya and Mischa…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.30,0:32:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,以九十分钟一百公里的速度运行\N{\fnArial\fs30}both in 90-minute earth orbit at 100 kilometers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.41,0:32:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 这是授权密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Here is the authorization code.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.44,0:32:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄金眼和今天的卫星操作序号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the GoldenEye and today's access numbers for satellite Petya, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.41,0:32:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在计时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am timing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.68,0:33:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Thank you, Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.06,0:34:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my count.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.76,0:34:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,三…二…一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three… two… one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.97,0:34:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,设定目标 塞维亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set target: Severnaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.68,0:34:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arm the weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.34,0:34:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,确认！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.86,0:35:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,救援最快l9分钟才能来 他们会晚到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their best response time is 19 minutes. They'll be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.56,0:35:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 我得清理掉一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's clean. I had to ventilate someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.60,0:36:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚安 钱班霓 - 晚安 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good evening, Moneypenny. - Good evening, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.77,0:36:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,M在军情室 我带你进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}M will meet you in the situation room. I'm to take you straight in.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.11,0:36:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没有下班后见过你 真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen you after hours, Moneypenny. Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.58,0:36:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢夸奖 詹姆斯 - 有特别任务吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you, James. - Out on a professional assignment?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.95,0:36:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,要去迷倒众生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dressing to kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.48,0:36:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你很失望 007\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you'll find this crushing, 007…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.18,0:36:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是坐在家里为国际事件祈祷…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't sit at home every night praying for an international incident…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.89,0:36:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我盛装赶来让詹姆斯邦德开眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I can run down here all dressed up to impress James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.62,0:36:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟一位绅士有约 一起去看戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was on a date with a gentleman. We went to the theater together.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.93,0:37:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱班霓 我好伤心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moneypenny, I'm devastated.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.56,0:37:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去你 我怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would I ever do without you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.10,0:37:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我的记忆里 詹姆斯 你从没得到过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as I can remember, James, you've never had me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.14,0:37:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有希望才有无限春梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope springs eternal.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.94,0:37:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 这种行为算是性骚扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this sort of behavior could qualify as sexual harassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.58,0:37:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？该怎么罚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? What's the penalty for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.18,0:37:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天你得实现你的讽刺话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someday you have to make good on your innuendos.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.29,0:37:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你先请 钱班霓 - 不 我坚持…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- After you, Moneypenny. - No, I insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.93,0:37:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你先请\N{\fnArial\fs30}You first.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.73,0:37:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 007 - 丹诺 什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good evening, 007. - Tanner. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.94,0:37:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们截获了一个遇险信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sixteen minutes ago, we intercepted a distress call…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.51,0:37:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自塞维亚废弃的雷达站\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a supposedly abandoned radar station at Severnaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.14,0:37:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看卫星拍的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what the satellite picked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.75,0:37:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到了失踪的“猛虎”直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found a match: your missing Tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.92,0:37:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在北俄罗斯中部吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the middle of Northern Russia.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.35,0:37:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜的没错 007\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems your hunch was right, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.35,0:38:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜你的邪恶的女上司不让你玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too bad the evil Queen of Numbers wouldn't let you play it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.86,0:38:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说的是？- 没有 我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were saying? - No, I was just…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.97,0:38:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 如我想听挖苦的话找我的孩子就行了 多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Because if I want sarcasm, Mr. Tanner, I'll talk to my children.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.80,0:38:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚安 007 - 晚安 M\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good evening, 007. - Good evening, M.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.97,0:38:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,首相在等最新报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Prime Minister's waiting for an update.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.41,0:38:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,请开始简报 丹诺先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proceed with your briefing, Mr. Tanner.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.51,0:38:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.08,0:38:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,求救讯号后直升机就起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the distress signal, your helicopter took off…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.85,0:38:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄军派三架米格机拦截\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Russians scrambled these three MIGs here to intercept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.52,0:38:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄国人用这基地做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think the Russians are using the base for?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.16,0:38:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前我们怀疑那也许是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at one point we suspected Severnaya might be the ground station…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.06,0:38:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,…秘密太空武器“黄金眼”计划的基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a secret space-based weapons program called GoldenEye, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.00,0:38:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的分析显示对方既无财力…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our statistical analysis saw they had…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.00,0:38:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,也无技术力量运作\N{\fnArial\fs30}neither the finance nor technology to implement it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.34,0:38:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我毫无数字观念\N{\fnArial\fs30}Numbers were never my strong suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.97,0:38:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些图片是立即传送的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are these pictures live?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.94,0:38:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们和美国政府不一样 不喜欢从CNN上得到坏消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unlike the American government, we prefer not to get our bad news from CNN.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.87,0:39:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前并无异状 一切正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative so far. Everything seems normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.14,0:40:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么搞的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the bloody hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.72,0:41:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜坦雅席蒙娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natalya Fyodorovna Simonova.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.73,0:42:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜坦雅席蒙娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natalya Fyodorovna Simonova!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.37,0:43:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,波洛！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boris!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.74,0:43:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,波洛！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boris!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.14,0:43:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.91,0:43:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的卫星被破坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our satellite is knocked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.91,0:43:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外两枚美国的也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are two of the Americans.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.62,0:43:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有另一枚正在进入轨道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have another coming into range…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.85,0:43:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在正在传送影像\N{\fnArial\fs30}now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.06,0:43:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good God.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.56,0:43:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,两架米格机坠毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two of the MIGs are down.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.56,0:43:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三架撞到卫星天线\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it looks like the third went into the dish.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.37,0:43:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.40,0:43:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有灯光\N{\fnArial\fs30}No lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.27,0:43:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,方圆三十里内全部停电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not one single electric light on in a 30-mile radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.41,0:43:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,电磁波？\N{\fnArial\fs30}E.M.P.?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.91,0:43:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 会引起米格机和卫星天线被毁 - 还有停电？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That explains the MIGs and satellites. - And the blackout.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.18,0:43:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,电磁波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Electromagnetic Pulse:
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.25,0:43:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一项美苏两国在冷战中…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A first-strike satellite weapon developed by the…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.02,0:44:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,研发的攻击性卫星\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Americans and Soviets during the Cold War.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.65,0:44:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过简报 广岛核爆后发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've read the brief. Discovered after Hiroshima.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.56,0:44:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在高层大气进行核爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set off a nuclear device in the upper atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.29,0:44:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,会产生激波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creates a pulse…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.89,0:44:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,极具毁灭性的辐射电流\N{\fnArial\fs30}a radiation surge that destroys everything with an electronic circuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.13,0:44:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在敌方反击前\N{\fnArial\fs30}The idea being to knock out the enemy's communications…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.93,0:44:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,中断对方通讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}before he, she, or they could retaliate.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.97,0:44:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以黄金眼确实存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, GoldenEye exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.37,0:44:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.54,0:44:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是意外吗？- 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Could this be an accident? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.04,0:44:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为直升机遭窃\N{\fnArial\fs30}The helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.91,0:44:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是运送黄金眼的最好工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wanted to steal the GoldenEye, it was the perfect getaway vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.08,0:44:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,把基地炸掉就能毁灭证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Setting off the blast was the ideal way to wipe out any trace of the crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.42,0:44:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚努一伙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Janus group?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.72,0:44:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能跟直升机有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may have been involved with the helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.42,0:44:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道俄国的安全措拖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the Russian failsafe systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.19,0:44:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能随便进去取得炸弹的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't just walk in and ask for the keys to the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.70,0:44:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须要有密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need the access codes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.94,0:44:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是有内贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had to be an insider.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.05,0:45:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少有一个人知道是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And at least one person probably knows who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.27,0:45:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好 谢谢 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well, sir. Thank you. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.21,0:45:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,首相与莫斯科联络过\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Prime Minister's talked to Moscow.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.21,0:45:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说例行演习出了意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're saying it was an accident during a routine training exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.65,0:45:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,换了政府还是照样说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Governments change. The lies stay the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.95,0:45:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚努帮有线索吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else do we know about the Janus syndicate?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.19,0:45:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,军火商大本营在圣彼得堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Topflight arms dealers, headquartered in St. petersburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.29,0:45:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,波斯湾战争中提供伊拉克军火\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first outfit to restock the Iraqis during the Gulf War.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.46,0:45:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,首脑身分不明 没有照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}The head man's unreliably described. No photographs.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.90,0:45:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那女人…安娜拓\N{\fnArial\fs30}The woman, Onatopp…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.10,0:46:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,…是唯一的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}is our only confirmed contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.47,0:46:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要来杯酒吗？- 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you care for a drink? - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.11,0:46:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的前任留下的干邑酒在上面… - 我喜欢波本酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your predecessor kept cognac in the… - I prefer bourbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.48,0:46:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加冰吗？- 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ice? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.59,0:46:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经调阅了在塞维亚每个能获得\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've pulled the files on anyone who might have had access…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.93,0:46:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用密码的人的档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}or authority at Severnaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.86,0:46:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知 榜首是你的老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}The top name on the list is an old friend of yours, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.63,0:46:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫洛莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ourumov.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.27,0:46:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他晋升了将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}They made him a General.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.81,0:46:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,自以为是俄国下一位铁腕人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sees himself as the next Iron Man of Russia.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.37,0:46:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,分析家认为他不可能叛国 他不在嫌疑犯名单上\N{\fnArial\fs30}So our political analysts rule him out He doesn't fit the profile of a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.95,0:46:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是这些分析家说黄金眼是不可能存在的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are these the same analysts who said that GoldenEye couldn't exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.32,0:46:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还说直升机事件没有威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who said the helicopter posed no immediate threat…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.82,0:46:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不值得调查？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wasn't worth following?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.72,0:46:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德 你不喜欢我 你也不喜欢我的做法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't like me, Bond. You don't like my methods.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.76,0:46:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为我是会计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm an accountant…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.69,0:47:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,做为会计 我更相信数据而不是你的直觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}a "bean counter, " more interested in my numbers than your instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.30,0:47:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是这么想过 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The thought had occurred to me. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.80,0:47:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我觉得你是个歧视女人厌恶女人的恐龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I think you're a sexist, misogynist dinosaur.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.64,0:47:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个冷战的遗留人物 他那男孩的魅力…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A relic of the Cold War…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.84,0:47:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管对我不管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}whose boyish charms, though wasted on me, obviously appeal…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.71,0:47:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,却迷倒了我派去评估你的少女\N{\fnArial\fs30}to that young woman I sent out to evaluate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.51,0:47:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我懂了 - 不完全 007\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Point taken. - Not quite, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.78,0:47:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你觉得我不敢派人送死\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you think for one moment I don't have the balls to send a man out to die…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.62,0:47:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可就大错特错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}your instincts are dead wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.19,0:47:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,派你送死我心安理得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've no compunction about sending you to your death.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.19,0:47:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不会轻举妄动 即使你以骑士的态度面对人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I won't do it on a whim, even with your cavalier attitude towards life.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.37,0:47:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你找到黄金眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to find GoldenEye.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.47,0:47:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,找出谁是主犯阴谋是什么并且加以阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find who took it, what they plan to do with it, and stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.10,0:47:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如是遇到巫洛莫不管有没有罪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you should come across Ourumov, guilty or not…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.51,0:47:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,遇上他千万别公报私仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you running off on some kind of vendetta.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.58,0:47:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,为艾力克报仇也救不活他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Avenging Alec Trevelyan will not bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.98,0:47:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是你让他害死的 - 也不是你杀的他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You didn't get him killed. - Neither did you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.41,0:47:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点你不必自责\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make it personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.78,0:47:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.66,0:48:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.13,0:48:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,活着回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.56,0:48:16.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（苏联 圣彼得堡）
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.67,0:48:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,早 巫将车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, General Ourumov.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.01,0:48:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,国防部长米西根 各位好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defense Minister Mishkin, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.08,0:48:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,请开始报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please deliver your report.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.85,0:49:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,据各位所知 一个秘密武器别号黄金眼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}As this Council is aware, 72 hours ago…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.85,0:49:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,…在72小时前在塞维亚遭到引爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}a secret weapon system code-named GoldenEye was detonated over Severnaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.46,0:49:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为太空部负责人\N{\fnArial\fs30}As head of Space Division…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.89,0:49:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会亲自调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I personally undertook the investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.76,0:49:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为这个罪行是西伯利亚分裂主义者所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have concluded this crime was committed by Siberian separatists…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.47,0:49:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望造成政治动乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeking to create political unrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.10,0:49:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不幸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regrettably, the peaceful work…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.11,0:49:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞维亚的太平的工作与外汇收入…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and much-needed hard currency earnings of Severnaya…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.61,0:49:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,…不得不倒退几年\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been set back by several years.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.71,0:49:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,在此我愿引咎辞职\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therefore, I tender my resignation.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.85,0:49:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,委员会不想拿你开刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems the Council does not want your head, Arkady Grigorovich.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.49,0:49:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你保证不会再有其他的金眼睛卫星武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merely your loyal assurance that there are no other GoldenEye satellites.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.96,0:49:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证 国防部长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can give you that assurance, Defense Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.06,0:49:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那失踪的两名技术员呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what of the two missing Severnaya technicians?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.63,0:49:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道一名 葛波洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was aware only of the one, Boris Grishenko.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.74,0:49:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一名女孩没找到尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a girl also whose body was not among the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.81,0:49:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜坦雅席蒙娜 二级程式设计师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natalya Fyodorovna Simonova, a level-two programmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.31,0:50:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会马上调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will investigate immediately, Defense Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.81,0:50:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你手下下落不明前\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would seem presumptuous, General…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.18,0:50:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,断然指责…\N{\fnArial\fs30}to blame this incident on Siberian separatists…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.35,0:50:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,西伯利亚分裂者不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the whereabouts of your own people are determined.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.89,0:50:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.09,0:50:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 部长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Defense Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.49,0:50:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你提醒我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for bringing it to my attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.76,0:50:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That will be all.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.91,0:50:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 Q 腿怎么了？滑雪跌伤？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, Q. Sorry about the leg. Skiing?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.72,0:50:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,打猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunting!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.62,0:50:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意 007\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Now pay attention, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.42,0:50:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的车 宝马\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, your new car, BMW.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.33,0:50:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,五段排档全方向雷达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agile, five forward gears, all-points radar…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.36,0:50:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,自动毁灭系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}self-destruct system…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.17,0:51:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,各种设备齐全\N{\fnArial\fs30}and naturally, all the usual refinements.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.70,0:51:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对这个特别感到骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this I'm particularly proud of.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.24,0:51:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,车灯后面 刺螯飞弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behind the headlights, stinger missiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.71,0:51:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 辛苦工作了一天 可以发泄一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent. Just the thing for unwinding after a rough day at the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.05,0:51:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要提醒你 007\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need I remind you, 007…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.42,0:51:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你有杀人执照…\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you have a licence to kill…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.79,0:51:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但开车还是不能违规\N{\fnArial\fs30}not to break the traffic laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.92,0:51:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我怎么敢 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wouldn't think of it. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.99,0:51:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在来点实用知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Let's get on to more practical matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.49,0:51:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,普通男用皮带\N{\fnArial\fs30}A typical leather belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.33,0:51:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,三十四寸 扣环式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Male, size 34, buckle notch.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.97,0:51:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玩完了没？- 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you finished? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.27,0:51:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 普通皮带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. A typical leather belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.34,0:51:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意我很熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Q, I'm familiar with that device.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.18,0:51:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮带扣藏有75尺钢丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not one with a 75-foot rappelling cord built into the buckle.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.85,0:51:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能射出铁勾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire, and out shoots a piton…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.18,0:51:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,加上强韧钢丝支撑你的重量\N{\fnArial\fs30}followed by a high-tensile wire designed to support your weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.99,0:51:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我要载人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see. And what if I need additional support?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.42,0:51:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能一个人用 007\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's tested for one, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.20,0:52:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,878班机到圣彼得堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flight 878 to St. petersburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.44,0:52:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,X光文件扫描器\N{\fnArial\fs30}X-ray document scanner.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.61,0:52:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,笔 这是一只四级手榴弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pen. This is a Class Four grenade.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.71,0:52:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,按三次后四秒引爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three clicks arms the four-second fuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.41,0:52:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上再按三次就取消\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another three disarms it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.12,0:52:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说时间多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long did you say the fuse was?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.79,0:52:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,别玩了 007！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, grow up, 007!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.89,0:52:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都说笔比剑更可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}They always said the pen was mightier than the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.89,0:52:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我 此话成真\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to me, they were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.63,0:52:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们请费迪示范一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, let's ask Freddie here to demonstrate for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.73,0:52:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 费迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are. Sorry about this, Fred.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.13,0:52:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}One… two… three.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.41,0:52:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,别多嘴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.41,0:52:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,墙上的涂鸦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The writing's on the wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.41,0:52:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有他的残舷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Along with the rest of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.55,0:52:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你试着让这些装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, 007, do please try and return some of…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.86,0:53:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,完璧归赵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do please try and return some of this equipment in pristine order.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.43,0:53:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰那个！那是我的午餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch that! It's my lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.62,0:53:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦敦四月是春天\N{\fnArial\fs30}In London, April's a spring month.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.69,0:53:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？你在报导气象吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah? And what are you, the weatherman?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.73,0:53:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 另一个有密码和口令…\N{\fnArial\fs30}For crying out loud, another stiff-assed Brit…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.56,0:53:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,…的英国佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your secret codes and your passwords.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.47,0:53:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天 你们得学学别用这套\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of these days you guys are going to learn just to drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.44,0:53:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧 我的车在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, my car's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.02,0:54:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你先请 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- After you. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.89,0:54:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你说的 别来这套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you said, drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.29,0:54:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 在伦敦四月是春天\N{\fnArial\fs30}In London, April's a spring month…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.36,0:54:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣彼得堡却冷得要命\N{\fnArial\fs30}whereas in St. petersburg we're freezing our butts off!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.43,0:54:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样够了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, is that close enough for government work?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.50,0:54:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不够 给我看玫瑰\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Show me the rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.44,0:54:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,饶了我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.94,0:54:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.65,0:54:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- “小毛”？- 我第三个老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Muffy"? - Third wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.52,0:54:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是中情局魏杰克 - 英国佬 詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jack Wade, CIA. - James Bond, stiff-assed Brit.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.06,0:54:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 身手不错 - 你的车也不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's a nice move. - Nice car.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.20,0:54:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个宝贝还没抛过锚呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}This baby hasn't let me down yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.06,0:54:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不中看却很中用\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's an ugly little bitch, but she gets you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.67,0:54:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 邦德？你种花吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Bond, you do any gardening?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.19,0:55:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米 把钳子拿给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand me that wrench, Jimmy?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.36,0:55:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你对亚努了解多少？- 一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you know about Janus? - Zilch. Zipsky.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.49,0:55:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人见过他 但他有高官相护\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's ever seen him. But the man's connected up the kazoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.23,0:55:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,KGB 军方螺丝起子\N{\fnArial\fs30}KGB, military. Screwdriver.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.07,0:55:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说他住在旧苏联飞弹列车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rumor has it, he lives on one of those old Soviet missile trains…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.04,0:55:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,包着铁甲到处开 所以我们无法追踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}that armored stuff they ran around the country so we couldn't target them.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.21,0:55:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,把鎚子给我好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to hand me that hammer, Jimbo?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.78,0:55:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 大的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the bigger one. The sledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.52,0:55:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 你找不到这家伙 只有他找得到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyways, to tell the truth, you don't find this guy. He finds you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.79,0:55:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼 不都是一些俄国黑手党\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, it's all Russian Mafia.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.86,0:55:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能带你找他的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best thing I can do is point you in the direction of his competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.73,0:55:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个对手是谁？- 前KGB的人 凶汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is the competition? - An ex-KGB guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.60,0:56:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,右脚瘸了 叫祖考斯基\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tough mother. Got a limp on his right leg. Name's Zukovsky.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.44,0:56:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 维伦汀祖考斯基？- 对呀 你认识他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Valentin Dimitreveych Zukovsky? - Yeah. You know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.27,0:56:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是被我打跛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave him the limp.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.57,0:56:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.80,0:56:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这些吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are these all you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.97,0:56:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还要多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.94,0:56:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国学校24台 瑞典11台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-four for the American school, eleven for the Swedish.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.08,0:56:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,IBM相容 五百MG硬碟\N{\fnArial\fs30}IBM compatible with 500 meg. hard drives…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.95,0:56:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,附光碟机和数据机\N{\fnArial\fs30}CD ROM and 14.4 modems.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.45,0:56:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 付美金吗？- 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will you pay dollars? - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.82,0:56:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,若女士需要 我可以演示…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If madame would require a demonstration, I could…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.16,0:56:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要一个样品到安静的地方试用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madame requires one demonstration model and a quiet place to test it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.36,0:57:05.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（电子邮件接收）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.97,0:57:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜坦雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natalya.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.77,0:57:18.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我以为你死了）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.88,0:57:29.66,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巫将车大开杀戒发射卫星武器 取走黄金眼）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.66,0:57:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都满意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everything satisfactory?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.03,0:57:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不被你打搅扰很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything except the interruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.26,0:57:39.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你很危险 别信任别人）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.86,0:57:45.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一小时后教堂见）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.68,0:57:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我弄清楚 吉米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now let me get you straight, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.74,0:57:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你射伤了他的脚偷走他的车和女友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shot him in the leg, you stole his car, you took his girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.85,0:57:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在却要他帮你和亚努见面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you want Valentin Zukovsky to set you up with Janus?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.82,0:57:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.35,0:58:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干什么？你想打动他的心吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what are you going to do? Appeal to his heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.69,0:58:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他的钱包\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, his wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.62,0:58:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 这可能有用 好啦 好戏上场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that might work. Okay, show time.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.50,0:58:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,大本营在23大楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valentin operates out of building number 23 there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.70,0:58:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的要这么做吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you want to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.57,0:58:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次有人硬闯 结果被化成灰…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last guy who dropped in uninvited went home airfreight…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.77,0:58:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,…装在小盒子送上飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}in very small boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.94,0:58:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要坐头等舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure they send me home first-class.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.10,0:59:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜坦雅！是我 波洛！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natalya, it's me! It's Boris!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.40,0:59:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,波洛！波洛！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Boris! It's Boris! Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.08,0:59:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天倒霉透顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another morning shot to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.42,0:59:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由市场经济会害死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free market economy. I swear it will be the end of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.06,0:59:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,PPK 7.65口径\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walther PPK, 7.65 millimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.63,0:59:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道只有三个人用这种枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only three men I know use such a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.40,0:59:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我杀了两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe I've killed two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.93,0:59:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,算我走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.47,0:59:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不见得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think not.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.86,1:00:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.17,1:00:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,魅力十足的情报员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charming, sophisticated secret agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.00,1:00:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,处变不惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shaken but not stirred.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.17,1:00:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的幽默感还在 维伦汀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you haven't lost your delicate sense of humor, Valentin, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.98,1:00:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是需要观众\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or your need for an audience.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.78,1:00:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁唱歌像鸡叫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's strangling the cat?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.88,1:00:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,像鸡叫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strangling a cat?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.96,1:00:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱琳娜 我的情妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is Irina, my mistress.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.96,1:00:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺有才华的女郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}A very talented girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.30,1:00:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱琳娜！给我滚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irina! Take a hike!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.34,1:01:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Mr. Bond…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.17,1:01:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么风把你吹来当邻居？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what is it that brings you to my neighborhood, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.44,1:01:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还替老掉牙的情报局做事呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still working for MI6…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.55,1:01:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是跨入21世纪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}or have you decided to join the 21st century?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.22,1:01:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说新M是个女的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear the new M is a lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.22,1:01:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你帮个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.36,1:01:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要我帮个忙！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants me to do him a favor!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.79,1:01:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的膝盖…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My knee aches…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.40,1:01:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天都痛 冬天更痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}every single day, twice as bad when it is cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.57,1:01:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道苏俄冬天有多长吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you any idea how long the winter lasts in this country, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.94,1:01:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他 老弟！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him, Dimitri!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.51,1:01:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个么 要看… - 闭嘴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, it depends… - Silence!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.87,1:01:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这过去的KGB干员 你让我吃惊啊 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}For an ex-KGB agent, you surprise me, Valentin.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.78,1:01:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是故意射你膝盖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone of your stature must've realized the skill was not to hit your knee…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.95,1:01:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是饶你老命\N{\fnArial\fs30}but to… miss the rest of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.59,1:01:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么饶我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why did you not kill me?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.82,1:01:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是职业上的礼貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call it professional courtesy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.93,1:02:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我还得报答你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I should extend you the same courtesy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.83,1:02:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,下午四点契氏殡仪馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kirov's funeral parlor, 4:00 this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.04,1:02:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,棺材藏有两百磅强力炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two hundred pounds of C4 explosives hidden in a casket.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.57,1:02:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手下把棺材载去换钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your man drives the hearse in, the money's exchanged…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.11,1:02:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对方把棺材接走\N{\fnArial\fs30}their man drives the hearse out.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.61,1:02:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果他们因炸药被逮捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their man will be arrested with the explosives.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.45,1:02:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的人就能带着你的钱奇迹式脱身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your man will make a miraculous escape with the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.82,1:02:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your money.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.55,1:02:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用什么跟你交换？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do I owe for this accommodation?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.49,1:02:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你安排我和亚努见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to set me up… with Janus.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.73,1:02:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么会惹上你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What has he done to deserve you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.20,1:02:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他偷了架直升机 - 我有六架\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stole a helicopter. - I have six.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.83,1:02:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,三架 其他的不能飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three. None that fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.90,1:02:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁管它？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's counting?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.70,1:02:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人是卖国贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are not just criminals, Valentin, they're traitors.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.07,1:02:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们偷走核武\N{\fnArial\fs30}They used the chopper to steal a nuclear weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.81,1:02:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,滥投俄国无辜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killed a lot of innocent Russians doing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.85,1:02:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哥萨克人本性 - 谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you expect from a Cossack? - Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.55,1:02:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说亚努 我没见过他 可我知道他是哥萨克人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Janus, I've never met the man, but I know he's a Lienz Cossack.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.19,1:03:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,二次大战与纳粹合作对抗俄国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Group that worked for the Nazis against the Russians, Second World War.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.89,1:03:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂历史嘛 战争结束后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know your history, Mr. Bond. At the end of the war…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.49,1:03:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥萨克人向奥地利的英军投降…\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Lienz Cossacks surrendered to the British in Austria…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.13,1:03:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,…以为能和英军对抗俄共\N{\fnArial\fs30}believing they'd join your government and wage war against the communists.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.53,1:03:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是被英国人出卖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, the British betrayed them…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.54,1:03:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,送回苏联后被斯大林下令处死\N{\fnArial\fs30}sent them promptly back to Stalin who promptly had them all shot…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.31,1:03:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,老弱妇孺\N{\fnArial\fs30}women, children, families.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.94,1:03:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我们的光荣时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly our finest hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.55,1:03:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很残暴 死了活该\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, ruthless people. They got what they deserved.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.48,1:03:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你安排我见亚努 跟他提直升机的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to set me up with Janus. Tell him I'm asking about the chopper.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.89,1:03:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚在欧洲大饭店碰面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to meet me tonight at the Grand Hotel Europe.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.39,1:03:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩就扯平了 那么他却欠我个人情？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, you and I are even and he owes me one?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.39,1:03:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.85,1:04:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,中校 你不需要用枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need the gun, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.41,1:04:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这要看你的安全做爱的定义是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That depends on your definition of "safe sex."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.49,1:04:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就够近的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's close enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.86,1:04:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for what I have in mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.19,1:05:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能伤得了我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you think you can hurt me?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.27,1:05:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能驯服我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can break me?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.90,1:05:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯！嗯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.67,1:05:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.91,1:06:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.11,1:06:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要前戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more foreplay.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.52,1:06:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我见亚努\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me to Janus.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.77,1:06:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是这个？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is it? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.94,1:06:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我必须说…我有个愉快的夜晚 你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I must say, I've had a lovely evening. You?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.38,1:06:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次又是你的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, once again, the pleasure was all yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.98,1:06:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怪我不跟你联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll understand if I don't call.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.98,1:06:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会睡不着觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't lose sleep over it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.95,1:06:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就做个好梦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.16,1:08:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.29,1:08:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾力克？- 死人复活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alec? - Back from the dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.29,1:08:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再是情报局纪念墙上的无名氏\N{\fnArial\fs30}No longer just an anonymous star on the memorial wall at MI6.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.86,1:08:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？不是开玩笑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter, James? No glib remark?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.66,1:08:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不反言相讥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pithy comeback?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.57,1:08:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.07,1:08:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这问题真可笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hilarious question, particularly from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.17,1:08:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问过为什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever ask why?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.18,1:08:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何要努力推翻暴政强权？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why we toppled all those dictators, undermined all those regimes?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.31,1:08:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,回国被褒扬一番\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only to come home: "Well done, good job. But sorry, old boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.98,1:09:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后发现生活全变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you risked your life and limb for has changed."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.89,1:09:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是我们的选择 - 你一定会这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was the job we were chosen for. - Of course you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.79,1:09:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯邦德 女王的忠犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Bond, Her Majesty's loyal terrier…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.73,1:09:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,捍卫所谓的“信仰”\N{\fnArial\fs30}defender of the so-called "faith."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.03,1:09:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托啦 詹姆斯 把枪拿开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please, James, put it away.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.53,1:09:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你每一步都在我意料之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's insulting to think I haven't anticipated your every move.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.87,1:09:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.18,1:09:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我信任你 艾力克 - 信任？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I trusted you, Alec. - Trust?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.11,1:09:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a quaint idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.05,1:09:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么情报局没发觉你父母是哥萨克人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did the MI6 screening miss that your parents were Lienz Cossacks?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.05,1:09:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又错了 他们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once again, your faith is misplaced. They knew.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.89,1:09:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是孤儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're both orphans, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.53,1:09:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的父母有幸死于山难\N{\fnArial\fs30}But where your parents had the luxury of dying in a climbing accident…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.56,1:09:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父母逃过英人的背叛和斯大林的毒手\N{\fnArial\fs30}mine survived the British betrayal and Stalin's execution squads.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.54,1:09:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲却不愿他们自己活在耻辱中\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my father couldn't let himself, or my mother, live with the shame of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.01,1:09:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,情报局以为我太小不记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}MI6 figured I was too young to remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.58,1:10:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,而人生却少有的讽刺\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in one of life's little ironies…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.28,1:10:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,父母被英国出卖决定自尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}the son went to work for the government whose betrayal…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.62,1:10:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子却为这国家工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}caused the father to kill himself and his wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.95,1:10:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才会变成亚努\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hence, Janus.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.19,1:10:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,双面的罗马门神\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two-faced Roman god come to life.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.66,1:10:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这脸非上帝造成 是拜你所赐\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't God who gave me this face, it was you…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.43,1:10:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,把炸弹设定三分钟而不是六分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}setting the timers for three minutes instead of six.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.43,1:10:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该同情你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I supposed to feel sorry for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.44,1:10:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你该为我而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You're supposed to die for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.78,1:10:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, by the way…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.58,1:10:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我本想邀你参加我的小计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did think of asking you to join my little scheme…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.61,1:10:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but somehow I knew…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.25,1:10:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,007永远把任务摆在朋友之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}007's loyalty was always to the mission, never to his friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.49,1:10:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,散场了 最后通知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Closing time, James. Last call.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.71,1:11:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了英国 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}For England, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.65,1:11:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mister!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.41,1:11:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒！拜托！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.62,1:11:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 醒醒！- 我在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wake up! - I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.79,1:11:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在这儿！- 快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm here! - Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.19,1:11:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up! Come out!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.72,1:11:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,振作点 我们快死了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull yourself together! We're going to die!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.03,1:11:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,想个办法 从这出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do something! Get us out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.33,1:11:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被绑住了 算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a little tied up Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.62,1:11:33.09,Note,0,0,0,0,,（发射时间）
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.87,1:11:45.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（发射）
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.55,1:12:04.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（目标）
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.96,1:12:10.82,Note,0,0,0,0,,（紧急跳出）
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.18,1:12:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,收集飞机里程数还真辛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}The things that we do for "frequent flyer" mileage.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.32,1:12:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我帮你一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.52,1:12:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样 小心头\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it, mind your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.00,1:13:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.08,1:13:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.55,1:13:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你是一伙 来帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'm on your side. I'm here to help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.62,1:14:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我什么都不知道…- 我不相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know anything. - I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.12,1:14:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不在乎 - 瞧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't care what you believe. - Look!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.12,1:14:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们随时都会回来 你要么趁机跟我走…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They might be back for us any minute. You either take your chances with me…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.26,1:14:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者跟随塞维亚杀人屠夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}or your fellow countrymen who killed everyone at Severnaya.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.59,1:14:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没去过塞维亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been to Severnaya.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.53,1:14:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的表去过 在金眼睛爆炸中停了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your watch has. Frozen by the GoldenEye blast.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.87,1:14:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜你一定是爬上接收盘后逃出来的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm willing to bet you're the one who climbed up the dish to get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.31,1:14:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？- 我替英国政府做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - I work for the British government.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.84,1:14:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的越多我就越有办法帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the more you tell me, the more I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.41,1:14:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我什么都不知道 - 从你知道的开始说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But I don't know anything! - Then let's start with what you do know.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.32,1:14:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫娜坦雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Natalya Simonova.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.76,1:14:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞维亚的程式设计师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a systems programmer at Severnaya facility until.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.43,1:14:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,说下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.77,1:14:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 直到他们杀死了所有人 - 谁？艾力克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Until they killed everyone. - Who? Alec Trevelyan?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.07,1:14:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I don't know who that is.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.07,1:14:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是内贼？叛徒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was the insider? Who was the traitor?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.81,1:15:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛波洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boris. Boris Grishenko.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.21,1:15:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- KGB还是军方？- 电脑程式设计师\N{\fnArial\fs30}- KGB or military? - Computer programmer.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.28,1:15:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没别人了吗？- 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There was no one else? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.22,1:15:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going to kill me, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.99,1:15:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.96,1:15:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信你？我连你叫什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust you? I don't even know your name.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.97,1:15:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,早 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.57,1:15:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.74,1:15:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是国防部长 米西根\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Defense Minister Dimitri Mishkin.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.45,1:15:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么处决你 邦德先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, by what means shall we execute you, Commander Bond?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.82,1:15:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？不先聊聊吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, no small talk?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.99,1:15:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不打屁一下？现在的人都不懂得严刑拷打\N{\fnArial\fs30}No chitchat? That's the trouble with the world today.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.66,1:15:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个失传的艺术\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one takes the time to do a sinister interrogation anymore. It's a lost art.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.33,1:15:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不欣赏你的幽默\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sense of humor doesn't slay me, Commander. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.30,1:15:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 黄金眼在哪里？- 你没有吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is the GoldenEye? - I assumed you had it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.60,1:15:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有英国间谍 塞维亚人程式设计师和直升机…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an English spy, a Severnaya programmer and the helicopter they took.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.34,1:16:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,贵国叛徒想要的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what some traitor in your government wanted it to look like.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.31,1:16:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁背后指使你攻击？- 谁有在弄权…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who was behind the attack on Severnaya? - Who had the authorization codes?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.11,1:16:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怖份子还是死罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Russia may have changed, but the penalty for terrorism is still death!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.81,1:16:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 叛国罪呢？- 你们俩都住口！闭嘴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And what's the penalty for treason? - Stop it, both of you! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.08,1:16:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们简直就像小孩子抢玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're like boys with toys.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.52,1:16:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是巫洛莫 是他发射武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Ourumov. General Ourumov set off the weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.09,1:16:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲眼目睹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw him do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.66,1:16:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you certain it was Ourumov?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.27,1:16:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀死了每个人 还偷走了黄金眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. He killed everyone and stole the GoldenEye.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.47,1:16:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么这么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why would he do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.71,1:16:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有另一枚卫星\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is another satellite.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.25,1:16:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一颗黄金眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another GoldenEye?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.18,1:16:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 席小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Miss Simonova.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.62,1:16:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说严刑拷打失传了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were saying something about the lost art of interrogation, Mr. Bond?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.56,1:16:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,部长 我要抗议！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defense Minister, I must protest!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.19,1:16:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,此案由我调查 你太过分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my investigation. You are out of order.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.00,1:17:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知 你才过分\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what I am hearing, it is you who's out of order!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.17,1:17:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我见过这把枪 - 把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have seen this gun before. - Put it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.97,1:17:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟我们的敌人共处 - 把枪放下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In the hand of our enemy. - Put it down, General!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.81,1:17:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道敌人是谁吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you even know who the enemy is, Dimitri?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.91,1:17:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道吗？- 警卫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you? - Guard!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.78,1:17:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,国防部长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defense Minister Dimitri Mishkin…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.12,1:17:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,被英国情报员詹姆斯邦德杀害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}murdered by a British agent, James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.83,1:17:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他逃亡时也遭到射杀 警卫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Himself shot while trying to escape. Guards!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.64,1:17:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.55,1:18:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在档案室！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in the archives!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.19,1:18:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.85,1:19:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外一边！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spread out! Cover the other side!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.95,1:19:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.15,1:20:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go now!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.02,1:20:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.94,1:21:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.22,1:21:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,开进巷子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down the alley!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.88,1:22:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快撞上去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use the bumper! That's what it's for!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.98,1:23:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.25,1:24:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,左转！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go left!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.66,1:25:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.35,1:26:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你没带来大礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either you've brought me the perfect gift, General Ourumov…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.65,1:26:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会让我很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you've made me a very unhappy man.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.72,1:26:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,米西根捷足先登\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mishkin got to them before I could.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.65,1:26:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德还活着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond is alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.29,1:26:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He escaped.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.79,1:26:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德得意了 你就糟糕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good for Bond. Bad for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.43,1:26:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下来吧 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a seat, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.98,1:26:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和詹姆斯无话不谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, James and I shared everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.22,1:26:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对是无话不谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.86,1:27:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜者为王\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the victor go the spoils.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.64,1:27:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会喜欢我们要去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll like it where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.02,1:27:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能还会喜欢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may even learn to like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.03,1:27:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with her.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.84,1:27:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.00,1:27:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.34,1:27:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要让我们出轨\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going to derail us.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.54,1:27:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,全速前进！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full speed!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.08,1:27:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,全速前进！撞死他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full speed! Ram him!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.08,1:28:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何不乖乖去死？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't you just be a good boy and die?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.58,1:28:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You first.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.82,1:29:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是下一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You… second.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.89,1:29:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.06,1:29:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况看来 陷入绝境了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Situation analysis: hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.66,1:29:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有后援 也没退路\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no backup, no escape route.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.13,1:29:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,而找还有一个筹码\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have the only bargaining chip.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.87,1:29:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.60,1:29:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你致命的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes. Your fatal weakness.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.01,1:29:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫洛莫 带她进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ourumov, bring her in.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.31,1:29:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.38,1:29:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝起来就…像草莓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tastes like… Iike strawberries.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.99,1:29:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可不知道 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wouldn't know. - I would.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.63,1:29:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,重回原点啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, back where we started, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.63,1:29:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,为朋友还是为使命？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend or the mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.44,1:29:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下 我就不杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the gun. I'll let her live.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.74,1:30:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫洛莫 他答应你什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ourumov, what has this Cossack promised you?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.45,1:30:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 对不对？他是哥萨克人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew, didn't you? He's a Lienz Cossack.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.85,1:30:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都过去了 - 他会背叛你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's in the past. - He'll betray you!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.12,1:30:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就跟别人一样 - 是真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just like everyone else. - Is this true?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.49,1:30:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实是48小时后我们会比上帝还有钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's true is that in 48 hours you and I will have more money than God.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.33,1:30:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里将为邦德先生开个小小的葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Mr. Bond here will have a small memorial service…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.93,1:30:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有钱班霓小姐和几个酒肉朋友会去\N{\fnArial\fs30}with only Moneypenny and a few tearful restaurateurs in attendance.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.44,1:30:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你打算怎么办 詹姆斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's the choice, James?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.88,1:30:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个目标 时间只能射一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two targets. Time enough for one shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.11,1:30:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,女孩 还是使命？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl, or the mission?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.11,1:30:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了她 她对我无任何意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill her. She means nothing to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.59,1:30:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱见吧 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you in hell, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.33,1:30:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一寸厚铁甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}One-inch armor plating.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.34,1:31:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine, thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.81,1:31:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 波洛 太好了！- 你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Boris, yes! - What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.41,1:31:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,波洛在线上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boris is on-line, backing up his files.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.85,1:31:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能找出他们的去处\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can spike him, I might be able to find out where they're going.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.49,1:31:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别光站在那儿！设法让我们逃生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't stand there! Get us out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.82,1:31:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.84,1:31:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck with the floor, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.35,1:31:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我设定时炸弹到六分钟引爆 跟你给我的六分钟一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I set the timers for six minutes, the same six minutes you gave me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.12,1:31:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我至少能对朋友做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the least I could do for a friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.59,1:31:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他什么意思？- 我们只有三分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What does that mean? - We've got three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.86,1:32:12.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（通讯中断 请传送破坏讯号）
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.96,1:32:13.89,Note,0,0,0,0,,（破坏讯号已传送）
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.57,1:32:27.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（输入密码 屁股和臀部）
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.81,1:32:28.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（无效）
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.63,1:32:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,屁股还叫什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else do you call your butt?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.09,1:32:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 波洛的密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It's Boris' password.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.33,1:32:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,“什么是能坐却不能带走？”\N{\fnArial\fs30}He plays word games: "What I sit on, but I don't take it with me."
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.40,1:32:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 椅子 - 我说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Chair. - Like I said.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.30,1:32:41.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（椅子 开始搜寻）
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.64,1:32:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩三十秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.14,1:32:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在俄国 德国 巴黎 伦敦 马德里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not in Russia, Germany, Paris, London, Madrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.58,1:32:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十五秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.08,1:32:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,…纽约 多伦多 芝加哥 旧金山…\N{\fnArial\fs30}New York, Toronto, Chicago, San Francisco.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.32,1:32:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十秒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty seconds!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.92,1:32:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨西哥市 里约 迈阿密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mexico City, Rio, Miami.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.46,1:33:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点呀！- 等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.39,1:33:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在古巴 哈瓦那 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in Cuba, Havana. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.83,1:33:06.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（断线）
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.10,1:33:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.85,1:33:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都破坏你所有乘坐的交通工具？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you destroy every vehicle you get into?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.55,1:33:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,标准操作程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standard operating procedure.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.46,1:33:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有玩具的男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Boys with toys."
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.53,1:33:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我该安排一下到古巴的交通工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I should take care of the transportation for our trip to Cuba.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.60,1:33:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,去古巴？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our trip?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.14,1:33:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会拆除卫星武器吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how to disarm the weapon?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.97,1:33:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这要看你说是哪种武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose that depends on what kind of weapon you're talking about disarming.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.91,1:34:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.18,1:34:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,…还有其他别的什么“标准操作过程”…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there any other standard operating procedures…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.59,1:34:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该知道的 中校？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should be aware of, Commander?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.36,1:34:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,数不完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thousands.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.30,1:34:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是都只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I only pay them…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.30,1:34:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘴上说说而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iip service.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.33,1:34:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一生都梦想到加勒比海\N{\fnArial\fs30}My whole life, I dreamed about coming to the Caribbean.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.10,1:34:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,真美极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.26,1:34:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,漫无人迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not another human being in sight.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.38,1:35:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟交通工具犯冲吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it with you and moving vehicles?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.37,1:35:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 老詹！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Jimbo!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.94,1:35:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那老头叫我带个礼物给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brought a little gift from old what's-his-name, uh, T, Z?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.55,1:35:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Q - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Q. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.31,1:35:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你来干嘛？- 榕树\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing here, Wade? - Banyan trees.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.98,1:35:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我没来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not here.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.69,1:35:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,中情局不知情不干涉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The CIA has no knowledge, no involvement, absolutely nothing to do…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.79,1:35:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到古巴跟我们无关 懂吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your insertion into Cuba, if you catch my drift.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.26,1:35:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂 我很明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I do, perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.56,1:35:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机是向缉毒组朋友借的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Borrowed the plane from a friend of mine in the DEA.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.86,1:35:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,海岸防卫队知道此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the Coast Guard and the FAA are both in the loop.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.60,1:35:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我们的雷达上消失了六小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're cleared on our radar for 0600 hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.50,1:36:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面有最新的探测仪器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the latest Sat-Int from Langley.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.90,1:36:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 保持六百尺以下 - 五百尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay below 600 feet. - 500 feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.94,1:36:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她是谁？- 娜坦雅席曼娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's that? - Natalya Siminova.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.34,1:36:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜坦雅席米娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natalya Simonova.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.85,1:36:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄国交通部长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Russian Minister of Transportation.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.72,1:36:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你查过她吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you check her out?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.39,1:36:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 从头到脚 - 好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Head to toe. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.86,1:36:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要找的足球场大的卫星天线 根本没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're looking for a dish the size of a football field, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.03,1:36:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在古巴什么事情也瞒不过我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't exist. You can't light a cigar in Cuba without us seeing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.63,1:36:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道一定有 跟塞维亚的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's there.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.07,1:36:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你们在纽西兰的秘密发射器一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a duplicate of Severnaya, like your secret transmitters in New Zealand.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.74,1:36:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没去过那 她怎么知道的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been to New Zealand. How'd she know about that?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.31,1:36:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要支援怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I need backup?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.64,1:36:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过广播联络 我会派海军陆战队来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on the radio. I'll send in the Marines.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.35,1:36:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑道尽头转左\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, hang a left at the end of the runway.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.45,1:36:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 古巴在右边八十英里 - 好啦 老魏！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cuba's 80 miles on your right. - Yo, Wade.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.22,1:36:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一件事 别乱按车上的钮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one thing: Don't push any of the buttons on that car.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.39,1:36:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只是兜兜风 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was going to go bombing around in it. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.33,1:37:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 我有信心 但你要小心点 他知道你要来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, James, I got faith. But be careful. He knows you're coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.70,1:38:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,特维阳是你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was your friend, Trevelyan?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.27,1:38:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他是你的敌人 你要杀死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now he's your enemy and you will kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.21,1:38:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is that simple?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.44,1:38:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说 一点也没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a word, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.41,1:38:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非他先杀死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless he kills you first.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.62,1:38:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 娜坦雅… - 你以为我会有好印象？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Natalya… - You think I'm impressed?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.88,1:38:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些人只会拿枪杀人 为了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you with your guns, your killing, your death. For what?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.29,1:38:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是为了当个英雄吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can be a hero?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.13,1:38:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 英雄难逃一死 - 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All the heroes I know are dead. - Natalya, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.49,1:38:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能这么做？你怎么能这么冷酷无情？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you act like this? How can you be so cold?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.67,1:38:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样才能活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what keeps me alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.57,1:38:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.44,1:38:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才会这么孤独\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what keeps you alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.21,1:39:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}James?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.82,1:39:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.29,1:39:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,在火车上…\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the train…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.46,1:39:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫他杀我 还说我对你无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you told him to kill me and I meant nothing to you…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.03,1:39:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you mean it?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.07,1:39:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.67,1:39:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本规则 一定要骗他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basic rule: always call their bluff.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.75,1:40:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.45,1:40:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,往南十度 方位一八四\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn ten degrees south, bearing one-eight-four.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.72,1:40:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.31,1:41:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没有 这里什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. There is nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.42,1:41:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,再绕一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's make another pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.00,1:41:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许老魏是对的 什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Wade was right. There is no dish.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.49,1:42:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜坦雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natalya.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.45,1:43:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 这次 换我占到上风了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time, Mr. Bond, the pleasure will be all mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.28,1:43:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下才到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for your turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.41,1:44:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一向都喜欢这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}She always did enjoy a good squeeze.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.53,1:44:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星进入接收范围吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the satellite in range?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.26,1:44:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再过六分钟 - 开启接收天线\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Six minutes. - Prepare the dish.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.37,1:44:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！太早 我还没好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! It's too early. I am not ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.34,1:44:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,开启\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.24,1:45:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪我们看不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder we couldn't see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.85,1:45:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.17,1:45:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,世上最好用的提款卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world's greatest cash card.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.34,1:46:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好别被拒收\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had better not be rejected.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.84,1:47:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天线已开启 - 长官！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mischa is on-line. - Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.34,1:47:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.45,1:47:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他老是学不了乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man just won't take a hint.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.08,1:47:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 目标座标 - 是伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Target coordinates? - The target is London.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.87,1:47:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他准备向卫星发出讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's getting ready to signal the satellite.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.57,1:47:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么阻止他？- 天线上的发射器\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you stop it? - The transmitter above the antenna.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.20,1:48:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,天线已就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Antenna in position.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.94,1:48:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my count.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.65,1:48:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three… two… one.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.14,1:48:38.73,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伦敦）
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.69,1:48:52.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（武器准备就绪）
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.84,1:48:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,天佑女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}God save the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.80,1:49:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑主机\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mainframe computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.87,1:49:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.72,1:50:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯！真是意想不到啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}James! What an unpleasant surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.89,1:50:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的目标是取乐于你 - 那女孩呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We aim to please. - Where's the girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.36,1:50:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她找到！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find her!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.94,1:51:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Q那老家伙好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how is old Q?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.74,1:51:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是他的老一套吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up to his usual tricks?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.01,1:51:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,手表\N{\fnArial\fs30}The watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.22,1:51:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,新款式\N{\fnArial\fs30}A new model.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.12,1:51:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是按这里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still press here, do I?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.90,1:51:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,装配得挺有趣 艾立克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting setup, Alec.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.54,1:51:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你侵入了英国银行电脑转帐…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You break into the Bank of England via computer…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.94,1:51:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,…把钱用电脑转出\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then transfer the money electronically…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.75,1:51:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后马上启动黄金眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}just seconds before you set off the GoldenEye…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.58,1:51:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁灭一切证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}which erases any record of the transactions.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.82,1:51:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真高明 - 谢谢 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ingenious. - Thank you, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.72,1:51:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这是小偷的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it still boils down to petty theft.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.83,1:52:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最终也不过是个银行抢劫犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the end, you're just a bank robber.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.46,1:52:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟个小偷差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing more than a common thief.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.76,1:52:12.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（进行编列密码）
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.78,1:52:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你眼光老是这么狭窄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always did have a small mind, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.68,1:52:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不只销毁银行记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just erasing bank records.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.81,1:52:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是毁灭全伦敦的电脑系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's everything on every computer in Greater London:
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.65,1:52:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,税捐记录 股市信用记录…土地登记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tax records, the stock market, credit ratings, land registries…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.19,1:52:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,犯罪记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}criminal records.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.06,1:52:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过十六分钟又四十三秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 16 minutes and 43 sec…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.76,1:52:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 四十二秒后英国将回到石器时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, 42 seconds, the United Kingdom will reenter the Stone Age.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.83,1:52:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,全球金融瓦解\N{\fnArial\fs30}A worldwide financial meltdown.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.43,1:52:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯狂的艾力克完成了五十年的凤愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all so mad little Alec can settle a score with the world 50 years on.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.54,1:52:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 拜托 詹姆斯别对我心理分析\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please, James. Spare me the Freud.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.18,1:52:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人无数以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might as well ask you if all the vodka martinis ever silence the screams…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.55,1:52:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,烈酒能让哀号宁静吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}of all the men you've killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.75,1:52:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那些女人怀中得到宽恕了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or if you find forgiveness in the arms of all those willing women…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.05,1:53:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于所有那些你不能保护的死者\N{\fnArial\fs30}for all the dead ones you failed to protect.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.29,1:53:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国将懂得背叛的代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}England is about to learn the cost of betrayal…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.83,1:53:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,1945年的萧条\N{\fnArial\fs30}inflation-adjusted for 1945.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.24,1:53:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欢迎加入 亲爱的 - 娜坦雅！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Welcome to the party, my dear. - Natalya!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.81,1:53:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再这么做了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ever do that again!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.34,1:53:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你玩不起这游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not one of your games, Boris.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.54,1:53:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,人真的会死 虫你这可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real people will die! You pathetic little worm.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.95,1:54:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在电脑主机上动过手脚 快查！\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was in the mainframe. Check the computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.35,1:54:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她这笨蛋 二流程式设计师\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a moron. A second-level programmer.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.62,1:54:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只处理过导航系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}She works on the guidance system.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.53,1:54:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没有发射密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't even have access to the firing codes.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.77,1:54:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,制动火箭发射中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retrorockets firing!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.79,1:54:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.89,1:54:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星十二分钟后重返大气层\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will have reentry in… 12 minutes!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.69,1:54:46.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（任务取消）
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.06,1:54:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 会在大西洋某地上空烧毁 - 快处理！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It will burn up over the Atlantic. - Deal with it!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.70,1:54:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她改了密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}She changed the access codes!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.17,1:54:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可以改回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then she can fix it.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:59.71,1:55:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管杀他 杀了他 他对我无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, shoot him. He means nothing to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.65,1:55:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.28,1:55:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以破解她的密码！- 那么 快做！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can break her codes. - Then get on with it!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.81,1:55:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他！快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him, now!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.95,1:55:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,把密码告诉我！告诉我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the codes, Natalya! Give them to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.47,1:56:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 波洛能破解密码吗？- 有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can Boris break your codes? - Possibly.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.24,1:56:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.84,1:56:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得摧毁发射器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to destroy the transmitter.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.28,1:56:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外 我很好 谢谢关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, I'm fine, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.91,1:56:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道怎么用吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how to use one of these?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:45.01,1:56:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.72,1:56:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Stay out of sight.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.83,1:57:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还剩多久？- 二分钟 一分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How long? - Two minutes. One minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.30,1:57:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 警卫！- 我正在做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guard! - I'm fixing it!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.57,1:57:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他敢溜就宰了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he moves, kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.02,1:57:42.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（重新设定时间 08点23分）
Dialogue: 0,1:58:35.02,1:58:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所向无敌！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! I am invincible!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.65,1:58:44.08,Note,0,0,0,0,,（天线重新定位）
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.71,1:59:15.34,Note,0,0,0,0,,（天线失效）
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.82,2:00:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 你要知道…我一向比你强\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, James… I was always better.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.81,2:01:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,一号呼叫基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha One to Gunship.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.38,2:01:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,一号呼叫基地！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha One to Gunship!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:15.28,2:02:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak to me!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:52.21,2:02:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了英国 詹姆斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For England, James?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:55.18,2:02:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.52,2:02:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,…为了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:18.20,2:04:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所向无敌！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! I am invincible!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:45.56,2:04:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯！詹姆斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}James! James!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:48.06,2:04:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:53.27,2:04:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm fine, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:05.45,2:05:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是被人看见怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suppose someone is watching?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:08.55,2:05:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,方圆25里内没人的 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. There's no one within 25 miles, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:12.85,2:05:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哟 老詹！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Jimbo!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:24.10,2:05:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这算是及时解围吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this supposed to be your idea of, uh, coming through in a clinch?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:29.97,2:05:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,烟草种植园 我说我会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's tobacco plants. I said I'd be here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.98,2:05:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,海军陆战队兄弟！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo! Marines!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:46.69,2:05:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不如到关塔那莫去继续互相亲热\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you two would like to finish debriefing each other at Guantanamo.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.06,2:05:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以吗？- 我不跟你坐直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ready? - I'm not going on a helicopter with you.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:55.36,2:05:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不跟你坐飞机或火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}No plane, no train, nothing that moves.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:58.70,2:06:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 怎么会有声？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darling, what could possible go wrong, eh?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:00.95,2:07:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,[为了纪念德瑞克·莫丁斯]
